  "0": {
   "segId": "Taanit.3b.1",
   "sugya": "taanit_3a_tal_veruchot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_eliyahu_ishtevuei",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וכי מאחר דלא מיעצר, אליהו אישתבועי למה ליה? -- if dew is not withheld, why did Elijah swear 'there shall be no dew' (I Kings 17:1)?",
     "against": "p_tal_lo_neetzar",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_tal_bracha",
     "gloss_en": "הכי קאמר ליה: אפילו טל ברכה נמי לא אתי (= p_tal_bracha_lo_ati)",
     "answers": "obj_eliyahu_ishtevuei",
     "restores": "p_tal_lo_neetzar"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_lihadrei_tal_bracha",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ולהדריה לטל דברכה? -- then let God restore the dew of blessing [in I Kings 18:1]!",
     "against": "p_tal_bracha_lo_ati",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_lo_minkera",
     "gloss_en": "משום דלא מינכרא מילתא (= p_lo_minkera)",
     "answers": "obj_lihadrei_tal_bracha",
     "restores": "p_tal_bracha_lo_ati"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_tal_bracha_lo_ati",
     "gloss_en": "this is what Elijah said: even the dew of blessing will not come"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Taanit.3b.6",
   "sugya": "taanit_3a_tal_veruchot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_avim_aavim",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ולא מיעצרי? והתני רב יוסף: ועצר את השמים — מן העבים ומן הרוחות ... קשיא עבים אעבים",
     "against": "p_avim_lo_neetzarim",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ruchot_aruchot",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ולא מיעצרי? והתני רב יוסף: ועצר את השמים — מן העבים ומן הרוחות ... קשיא רוחות ארוחות",
     "against": "p_ruchot_lo_neetzarot",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_veatzar",
     "gloss_en": "'and He will close up the heavens' (Deut 11:17) means from clouds and from winds: rain is said separately in 'and there will be no rain'"
    }
   ]
  },
  "6": {
   "segId": "Taanit.3b.7",
   "sugya": "taanit_3a_tal_veruchot",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_charfei_afelei",
     "gloss_en": "עבים אעבים לא קשיא: הא — בחרפי, הא — באפלי (early clouds / late clouds)",
     "answers": "obj_avim_aavim",
     "restores": "p_avim_lo_neetzarim"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
